    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702490/extras/ad7eba7b931bab09cf702860c2d42fd4.webp?t=1743374944\" width=598 height=42 /></span>TETRACHROMA adds a new dimension to the block stacking action of classic tetromino stacking games: <i>the colors of the blocks matter!</i> Pieces appear in two or more colors, and to clear a line, every block in the line must match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702490/extras/65d1c5ab228244bd1316ee9ef27904b0.poster.avif?t=1743374944\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702490/extras/65d1c5ab228244bd1316ee9ef27904b0.webm?t=1743374944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702490/extras/65d1c5ab228244bd1316ee9ef27904b0.mp4?t=1743374944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the board with a new color changing mechanic inspired by the classic board game Reversi. Placing a piece adjacent to a line changes the color of the line to match. Plan ahead to maximize your score and clear 15+ lines with a single piece. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern stacking mechanics with wall kicks, lock delay, spins, perfect clears, and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 hand designed puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ different gameplay modes playable in 400 line marathon and 100 line versions</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STANDARD:</strong> balanced for general play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONSOLE:</strong> classic retro console stacking mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BIG:</strong> double sized blocks for extra challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CELL:</strong> square board with modified piece set</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 10+ block styles and 20+ color palettes by clearing modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed settings for all skill levels: Peaceful, Easy, Normal, Hard, Master, and Death</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702490/extras/ad7eba7b931bab09cf702860c2d42fd4.webp?t=1743374944\" width=598 height=42 /></span>TETRACHROMA adds a new dimension to the block stacking action of classic tetromino stacking games: <i>the colors of the blocks matter!</i> Pieces appear in two or more colors, and to clear a line, every block in the line must match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702490/extras/65d1c5ab228244bd1316ee9ef27904b0.poster.avif?t=1743374944\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702490/extras/65d1c5ab228244bd1316ee9ef27904b0.webm?t=1743374944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702490/extras/65d1c5ab228244bd1316ee9ef27904b0.mp4?t=1743374944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the board with a new color changing mechanic inspired by the classic board game Reversi. Placing a piece adjacent to a line changes the color of the line to match. Plan ahead to maximize your score and clear 15+ lines with a single piece. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern stacking mechanics with wall kicks, lock delay, spins, perfect clears, and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 hand designed puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ different gameplay modes playable in 400 line marathon and 100 line versions</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STANDARD:</strong> balanced for general play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONSOLE:</strong> classic retro console stacking mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BIG:</strong> double sized blocks for extra challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CELL:</strong> square board with modified piece set</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 10+ block styles and 20+ color palettes by clearing modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed settings for all skill levels: Peaceful, Easy, Normal, Hard, Master, and Death</p></li></ul>",
